      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e That will set all_protected to 0, but UPDATE_BIT(NPCX_UMA_ECTS...) won\u0027t have any effect, right? And then all_protected is out of sync with NPCX_UMA_ECTS.\n\nExactly. In the driver it was hidden by restoring flash state from jump data at the end of `crec_flash_pre_init()`. `all_protected` will be set back to 1, if it was enabled in RO which \"fixes\" the problem.",
